Authorization: Basic {{org-user-id}} {{org-user-pw}}
content-type: application/json

###
# @name post_attachment_file
# POST "mcp/attachment_file" を呼び出し、添付ファイルを作成します(tools/call)
POST {{base_org_url}}/api/{{organization_id}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/mcp/attachment_file
Authorization: Basic {{org-user-id}} {{org-user-pw}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ExastroBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------ExastroBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello Exastro
Created by mcp/attachment_file Rest API
datetime=${{$localDatetime iso8601}}
------ExastroBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
